"Hot Lab 7 is Superior Professor Worli Ro-den's weapons lab at LeafSong University."
"It is a round, domed, windowless building of shiny black stone, air conditioned inside."
"An Artonan 7 marks its seamless door."
"A curved hallway leads to a decontamination area with sanitizing gear and rubber boots."
"Metal stairs lead down to the central lab, which has a wall display and locked supply cases."
"Joe's office overlooks the inner lab through a window."
"The office has smart boards, museum-like shelves, legless poofy chairs and a wevvi dispenser."
"An aquarium vat of venomous eels sits in the lab."
"The lab researches reducing 'overshred effects caused by magical ammunition'."
"Joe teaches Alden secret lessons about his skill here, bound by a contract of secrecy."
